# ============================================================
# .gitignore - Sistema Académico INA
# ============================================================

# --- .NET / Backend ---
## Build outputs
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/

## Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.vssscc
.vscode/
*.swp

## NuGet
packages/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
nuget.config

## dotnet
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.deps.json

## Docker
docker-compose.override.yml
.dockerignore

## Secrets / Configuración sensible (NO commitear)
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.Example.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

## Logs
*.log
logs/

## Test results
TestResults/
*.trx

# --- Node.js / Frontend ---
## Dependencies
node_modules/

## Build outputs
build/
dist/
*.local

## Environment files (sensitive)
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

## Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

## Testing
coverage/

## IDE / Editor
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Base de Datos ---
*.sql
!backend/migrations/*.sql
!*.md

# --- Archivos temporales / Uploads ---
**/wwwroot/uploads/
*.tmp
*.temp

# --- Certificados / SSL ---
*.pfx
*.p12
*.crt
*.key
*.pem

# --- Misceláneo ---
*.backup
*.bak
*.old